---
import { getEntry } from "astro:content";
import LegalLayout from "@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro";

const globalData = await getEntry("global", "site");
if (!globalData) throw new Error("Global site data not found");
const { site } = globalData.data;
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Medical Disclaimer"
  description="HealthShores provides general information and travel facilitation, not medical advice. Read this before relying on our content."
  updated="9 November 2026"
>
  <div class="callout">
    <strong>In a medical emergency, call your local emergency number or go to the nearest hospital
    immediately.</strong> Do not use our contact form or email for urgent medical needs.
  </div>

  <h2>Not medical advice</h2>
  <p>
    The information on www.healthshores.com, including articles, treatment descriptions, cost comparisons and any
    information shared by our team, is for general information only. It is not medical advice, and it is not a
    substitute for diagnosis or treatment by a qualified doctor who knows your medical history.
  </p>
  <p>
    Always consult your own doctor before deciding on any treatment, before travelling for treatment, and before
    starting or stopping any medication.
  </p>

  <h2>We are a facilitator, not a healthcare provider</h2>
  <p>
    HealthShores does not practise medicine and does not employ the doctors who treat our patients. Using our
    services does not create a doctor–patient relationship with HealthShores. Medical opinions, treatment plans and
    care are provided by independent hospitals and licensed doctors, who are responsible for them.
  </p>

  <h2>Results vary</h2>
  <p>
    Every patient is different. Outcomes, recovery times and risks depend on your individual condition and other
    factors. Any examples, success rates or patient experiences mentioned on this Website do not guarantee a similar
    result for you.
  </p>

  <h2>Costs are indicative</h2>
  <p>
    Prices and savings shown on this Website are general estimates for comparison only. Actual costs are set by
    hospitals and depend on your diagnosis, treatment plan, length of stay and other factors.
  </p>

  <h2>Travel and visa information</h2>
  <p>
    Visa rules, travel requirements and regulations change. Information on this Website may not reflect the latest
    requirements. Always check with official government sources and your treating hospital before you travel.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy and external links</h2>
  <p>
    We try to keep our content accurate and up to date, but we make no guarantee that it is complete or current.
    Links to other websites are provided for convenience; we are not responsible for their content.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>
    If you have questions about this disclaimer, contact us at
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or
    <a href={`tel:${site.phone.replace(/\s/g, "")}`}>{site.phone}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
